---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Edubuzz" description="Edubuzz privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your personal information." canonicalUrl={Astro.url.href} adsEligible={false}>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2">Last updated: 7 October 2026</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">This policy describes information handled by the public Edubuzz education and career site at edubuzz.co.za. Privacy questions and requests can be sent through the contact channel below.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Information we collect</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">The contact form asks for your name, email address and message. Submitted messages are sent through the site's configured email service so a reply can be made. Do not include ID copies, passwords, banking details or CVs in a general enquiry. Public guides do not submit job applications to employers. When configured, Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity can receive usage and device information; this should not be treated as a guarantee that all analytics data is anonymous.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">How we use your information</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1 list-disc pl-5 mb-4">
      <li>To respond to messages you send us</li>
      <li>To improve our website and content</li>
      <li>To understand how visitors use the site via analytics</li>
      <li>To comply with legal obligations under South African law</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Data sharing</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We do not sell your personal information. We share data only with service providers that help us operate the site (for example, analytics providers), and only as needed for those services.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We use cookies and similar technologies for essential functionality and configured analytics, including Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity. AdSense code is enabled on eligible content pages; Google determines whether ads can be served. See our <a href="/cookie-policy" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Google AdSense and advertising</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve advertisements based on visits to this site or other websites. Google's advertising cookies enable Google and its partners to serve ads based on those visits. Ad availability and personalisation depend on Google approval, account settings and applicable consent choices.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">You can manage personalised advertising through <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="text-green-800 underline">Google My Ad Center</a>. Read <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="text-green-800 underline">how Google uses information from partner sites</a> and the <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="text-green-800 underline">industry advertising opt-out information</a>. Where a consent message is shown, use it to manage the available choices. Browser cookie settings offer additional controls.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Data retention</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Contact messages are handled through the configured email service. This website does not implement an automatic 12-month deletion schedule. Retention also depends on the mailbox and analytics-provider settings. You can contact us to ask about information associated with your enquiry or to request deletion.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Your rights</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Under POPIA, you have the right to: access your personal data, request correction of inaccurate data, request deletion of your data, withdraw consent at any time, and lodge a complaint with the Information Regulator.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Security</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Use the HTTPS site when sending an enquiry. The public contact form does not ask for an account password. No online service can guarantee absolute security, so avoid sending unnecessary sensitive information.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">For privacy-related queries, contact us at <a href="/contact" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">edubuzz.co.za/contact</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
